{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-park-view-tower","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"park-view-tower-mesab-limited-al-reem-island","about":"Park View Tower is a 35-storey residential skyscraper with a contemporary design in the vibrant Shams neighborhood of Al Reem Island, Abu Dhabi. The project offers 2-3 bedroom apartments and duplexes with high quality finishes that maximize comfort. All apartments have 1 or 2 balconies with beautiful panoramic views of the Reem Islands.Residents have access to many amenities: high-speed elevators, swimming pool, sauna and Jacuzzi, gym, children's playground and covered parking. There is a spacious lobby on the second floor.The complex is surrounded by landscaped gardens where residents can walk and relax. Nearby is the Central Park of Rome with walking alleys overlooking the water canal, skateboarding area, bike trails along the mangroves, children's playground, tennis courts, picnic areas, cafes and restaurants.The infrastructure is actively developed. In addition to sandy beaches, there are many supermarkets, hospitals, entertainment and educational institutions within walking distance.Park View Tower is located near Al Shifa Bint Abdullah, Al Shematri and Al Quds streets, which lead to the heart of the emirate. Abu Dhabi International Airport is a 30-minute drive from the complex. Sheikh Khalifa Bin Zayed Al Nahyan Street, connecting Al Reem Island to Saadiyat, Al Jubail and Yas Islands, is a 15-minute drive from the complex.","price":2455000,"title":"Park View Tower","bitrix":{"id":751,"pf_id":"are.2.5265","source":null,"project_id":"Park View Tower","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Park View Tower","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Mesab Limited","project_location":"Park View City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/617/images/2023/12/20/340x252/xeB6YrPR97304qHrraLw2qgAjqnAS9sI40VSQ